# WiSiHe monorepo — environment variables
#
# This repo has no single root `.env`. Each app has its own example file:
#
#   apps/nextjs-portfolio/.env.example   → main site (Vercel)
#   apps/sanity-studio/.env.example      → Sanity Studio + Algolia scripts
#   apps/wisihe-ai/.env.example          → Sanity App SDK (AI assistant)
#
# Local dev (without Doppler):
#   cp apps/nextjs-portfolio/.env.example apps/nextjs-portfolio/.env.local
#   cp apps/sanity-studio/.env.example apps/sanity-studio/.env.local
#
# With Doppler: see docs/doppler-setup.md
